### ==============================================================================
### Akatsuki's Draft - API Tests (.http / REST Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@userToken = your_user_jwt_token_here
@adminToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here
@postId = your_post_id_here

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Check API Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & USER PROFILE
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Register Standard User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Itachi Uchiha",
  "email": "itachi@akatsuki.draft",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login Standard User
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "itachi@akatsuki.draft",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login Admin User
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@akatsuki.draft",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. USER POST MANAGEMENT
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create Draft Post
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "title": "The Art of Content Creation",
  "description": "Exploration of modern storytelling techniques in digital media.",
  "content": "Writing compelling content requires clarity, emotional resonance, and consistent focus on the target audience.",
  "category": "Writing",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a",
  "status": "draft"
}

### Submit Post Directly as Pending
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "title": "Understanding Collaborative Systems",
  "description": "Architectural principles behind distributed editorial workflows.",
  "content": "Editorial workflows thrive when permissions, statuses, and validation checks are strictly decoupled.",
  "category": "Technology",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Get Logged-in User's Posts (All Statuses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/my-posts?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Get Public List of Approved Posts (Search & Category Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&limit=10&category=Writing&search=clarity
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Single Approved Post by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Post (Edit title/content or change status to pending/draft)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "title": "The Art of Content Creation - Revised",
  "content": "Updated content emphasizing narrative structure, cadence, and reader engagement.",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Delete Post (Owner or Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. ADMIN APPROVAL WORKFLOW
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Pending Posts (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/pending?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve Pending Post (Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/approve/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject Pending Post with Optional Reason (Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/reject/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Please provide clearer examples and cite verifiable sources in the third section."
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. AI CONTENT IMPROVEMENT
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Improve Post with Google Gemini AI (Creates a new draft post)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/improve/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

